[159.703539, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# Every task finished. 'rejected' means not publishable, as for its source run S6, a pilot: only the coverage check G3 failed, the one a pilot is expected to fail, so the exit is 0. A replay is never published.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
