[174.110468, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# Publication faults: a SYNTHETIC test against a fixture, run here at 20:14Z to 20:16Z; not a retailer run\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[176.612264, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m sed -n 1,24p publication/README.txt\r\n"]
[177.614713, "o", "SYNTHETIC TEST: publication faults, release 1.5.2 (627c804), on Hamza's Azure test VM, 2026-11-01T20:14Z to 20:16Z.\r\n\r\nNot a retailer run. tests/integration/test_publication_safety.py ran from the delivered source (WALMART_SOURCE_1.5.2.zip,\r\nthe Oxylabs edition) against a fixture standing in for Walmart, on an isolated database and destination. No request left\r\nthe VM. The suite's result: 10 passed in 105.27 s (../logs/publication_faults.log; ../junit/test_publication_safety.xml).\r\n\r\nEach file records one fault. A first run publishes; a second run meets the fault. \"before\" and \"after\" are the last-good\r\npointer, the published files' SHA-256 and the published products, read before and after the second run.\r\n\r\n"]
[177.614831, "o", "  Fault                                 Second run                                    Last-good publication\r\n  publication_refused_incomplete        rejected, CREDITS_EXHAUSTED, exit 4           unchanged\r\n  publication_refused_site_refusal      rejected, SITE_REFUSAL, exit 5                unchanged\r\n  publication_refused_wrong_store       rejected, STORE_NOT_VERIFIED, exit 7          unchanged\r\n  publication_refused_empty             rejected, exit 6                              unchanged\r\n  publication_refused_thin              rejected, exit 6                              unchanged\r\n  publication_refused_failed_detail     rejected, exit 6: the product-page path       unchanged\r\n                                        paused after 3 refused or failed requests\r\n  publication_refused_mixed_lineage     publishing refused, exit 6: a segment ran     unchanged\r\n                                        with another lineage\r\n  publication_interrupted_then_retried  interrupted, then retried (exit 0)            kept until the retry published\r\n  publication_interrupted_run_then_resumed  stopped (exit 75); a manual publish       kept until the resumed run\r\n                                        refused (exit 6); resumed (exit 0)            published\r\n  publication_allowed_one_failed_detail published with one failed product page        replaced by version 2\r\n\r\n"]
[179.61678, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# The Oxylabs Classic offline probe 1.5.2: its plan, and the live command, which is refused; nothing is sent\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[182.118342, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m cd probe/oxylabs-classic-offline-probe-1.5.2/oxylabs-classic-probe\r\n"]
[185.121384, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m uv run --frozen classic-probe plan --targets config/targets.json | head -20\r\n"]
[186.220287, "o", "{\r\n \"campaign_id\": \"classic-proposal-walmart-marianos\",\r\n \"limits\": {\r\n  \"billing_headroom_usd\": \"0.50\",\r\n  \"campaign_minutes\": 30,\r\n  \"export_reserve_seconds\": 180,\r\n  \"per_retailer_requests\": 10,\r\n  \"retailers\": [\r\n   \"walmart\",\r\n   \"marianos\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"total_requests\": 20,\r\n  \"total_usd\": \"5.00\"\r\n },\r\n \"marianos\": [\r\n  \"marianos: this probe has no adapter for it (its share of the limits stays reserved)\",\r\n  \"marianos: the retailer's store ID is not verified from the source\"\r\n ],\r\n \"mode\": \"plan (nothing is sent, nothing is written)\",\r\n \"rates\": \"no rate card given: a live campaign would be refused\",\r\n"]
[188.233812, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m uv run --frozen classic-probe live --manifest ../../campaign.json | tail -12; echo exit ${PIPESTATUS[0]}\r\n"]
[189.344915, "o", " \"live\": \"refused\",\r\n \"missing\": [\r\n  \"live mode is disabled in this build (a later, separately approved version may enable it)\",\r\n  \"credentials: not checked while live mode is disabled\",\r\n  \"this ledger is an offline test ledger: it never authorizes a provider request\",\r\n  \"no explicit approval\",\r\n  \"the account's target entitlement is not verified\",\r\n  \"the account's maximum billing rates are not confirmed\",\r\n  \"credentials are not present\"\r\n ],\r\n \"nothing was sent\": true\r\n}\r\n"]
